{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.emergence_to_quantum_flat","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.emergence_to_quantum_flat","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":9,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.emergence_to_quantum_flat","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.emergence_to_quantum_flat","kind":"theorem","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/emergence_to_quantum_flat.lean#L43-L54","doc":"**INN(G_q) is the unique quantum-flat strict 2-group**\n([`prop:emergence-to-quantum-flat`]).\n\nAny strict 2-group `G'` satisfying the quantum-flatness condition\n`F_A = B` (under the simplicity constraint `F_A⁻ = 0`) is\nisomorphic to `INN(G_q)`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:emergence-to-quantum-flat","label":"prop:emergence-to-quantum-flat","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/emergence-to-quantum-flat.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.EmergenceToQuantumFlatContext.claim_emergence_to_quantum_flat","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.EmergenceToQuantumFlatContext.claim_emergence_to_quantum_flat","kind":"theorem","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/emergence_to_quantum_flat.lean#L40-L40","doc":"Manuscript uniqueness claim: every quantum-flat strict 2-group\nis isomorphic to `INN(G_q)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.EmergenceToQuantumFlatContext.TwoGroupIso","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.EmergenceToQuantumFlatContext.TwoGroupIso","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/emergence_to_quantum_flat.lean#L37-L37","doc":"The 2-group isomorphism (abstract). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.EmergenceToQuantumFlatContext.QuantumFlat","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.EmergenceToQuantumFlatContext.QuantumFlat","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/emergence_to_quantum_flat.lean#L35-L35","doc":"Type-level predicate \"this strict 2-group has the quantum-\nflatness property `F_A = B` reproducing `F_A⁻ = 0` under\nsimplicity\". ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.EmergenceToQuantumFlatContext.INN_G_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.EmergenceToQuantumFlatContext.INN_G_q","kind":"def","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/emergence_to_quantum_flat.lean#L31-L31","doc":"The inner-automorphism 2-group `INN(G_q)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.EmergenceToQuantumFlatContext.G_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.EmergenceToQuantumFlatContext.G_q","kind":"def","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/emergence_to_quantum_flat.lean#L29-L29","doc":"The QOU gauge group `G_q ≅ SU_q(2)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.EmergenceToQuantumFlatContext.A","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.EmergenceToQuantumFlatContext.A","kind":"def","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/emergence_to_quantum_flat.lean#L27-L27","doc":"The QOU substrate `A`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.EmergenceToQuantumFlatContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.EmergenceToQuantumFlatContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/emergence_to_quantum_flat.lean#L25-L25","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.E